MoveTo contains code derived from another work. Two sets of terms apply.

================================================================================
1. DERIVED PORTIONS - originally by Michael Dunn
================================================================================

The shell-extension plumbing in this project (the IShellExtInit /
IContextMenu structure, the registration code, the data-object and
DragQueryFile handling, and the precompiled header) is derived from DirClean
by Michael Dunn, published on CodeProject as "A Utility to Clean Up Compiler
Temp Files" (first release February 2000), by way of the 64-bit port at
https://github.com/ram-wiziiot/DirClean

His terms, reproduced verbatim from the original source headers, continue to
govern those portions:

    This utility written and copyright by Michael Dunn (mdunn at inreach
    dot com).  You may freely use and redistribute this source code and
    binary as long as this notice is retained.

    Contact me if you have any questions, comments, or bug reports. Get
    the latest updates at http://home.inreach.com/mdunn/code/

That notice is retained in every file derived from the original and must
remain there in any redistribution. The contact address and URL are no longer
reachable; they are preserved because the notice requires it. CodeProject
itself shut down in 2024 and its domain is now parked.

